You see a shaggy, scary looking beast with saber sharp teeth on the cover of another book. You take a quick look through the book. Aha, here is what it says:
"...this beast, that travelers called saber-tooth wolf - is one of the largest predators of the Wild Island. It is primarily nocturnal creature. Tough fell and thick layer of hypodermic tissue serve as fine armor, capable of stopping a rifle bullet. Intolerant to loud and shrill sounds. Also incapable of climbing trees, that can save an unlucky journeyman who meets it."
You close the book and shiver. It's better not meet such a beast...